<title>USA: Seagate announces profit sharing plan.</title>
<headline>Seagate announces profit sharing plan.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTS VALLEY, Calif 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seagate Technology Inc said more than 90,000 employees worldwide will receive profit sharing equivalent to about 41 hours of pay for the just-completed second quarter of fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>It is Seagate's highest profit-sharing payout in the last 20 consecutive quarters, the company said.</p>
<p>Corporate officers and commissioned sales people are not eligible, it said.</p>
</text>
